    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30791" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕθεν</span></b>  (i.e. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ϝέθεν</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
